Description: SecuBox Mail Module
 Complete email server management API and dashboard.
 Postfix/Dovecot mail server and Roundcube webmail in Debian LXC containers.
 .
 Features:
  - User/alias management via mailctl
  - DKIM/SPF/DMARC configuration
  - ACME certificate automation (Let's Encrypt)
  - Service monitoring
  - Webmail integration (Roundcube in LXC)
  - Three-fold architecture (components, status, access)
 .
 For Let's Encrypt certificates, install acme.sh:
   curl https://get.acme.sh | sh
